## 3. Information and execution flow

```text
External research
  ↓
Evidence and source references
  ↓
01_GOVERNANCE_AND_VERIFICATION
  Claim review, verification, and confidence classification
  ↓
GitHub repository
  Versioned methodologies, frameworks, and structured knowledge
  ↓
AI-supported analysis
  ↓
Human strategic and commercial decision
  ↓
Monday operational execution
  ↓
Measurement and lessons returned to the repository
```

Verification is a governed review step. Storing material in GitHub does not by
itself make that material verified. AI supports analysis and drafting; people
retain authority over strategic, legal, commercial, and institutional
decisions.
